  "duration_s": 135.370884,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "私下给你提个醒，最近有人跑我这儿打你小报告。领导相比于谁说坏话，我更在意怎样把工作做好。如果是我的问题，我马上改，如果没问题，非常感谢您的信任。大家都看看小王这个月业绩做的这么好，谢谢领导夸奖。那都是我们的产品好，团队强，客户才会放心下单。看你手头这进度干活，怎么比乌龟还慢慢俗，俗说慢慢出细题吗？我细致对待每一个项目，不就避免了以后出现质量问题吗？上次交代的那个重点项目现在推进的怎么样了？领导第一阶段已完成，目前正处于复核阶段，预计本周内能够全部交到。您手上。给你转了一千多的，就当你跑腿的小辛苦费了啊，领导，您太客气了，水果没多少钱，您平时对我们这么照顾，帮您买水果是我应该做的多的钱我不能收我，这就给您退回去。小王，早餐钱，我微信转给你了，你赶紧接收一下。领导，您太客气了，这都是我顺手的事儿，本来不应该收的，但是怕您下次有事就不找我了，所以我就恭敬不如从命了。小餐方案思路很清析，这次干的不错嘛，谢谢领导的夸奖，都是因为有您的指导和提点，我才能取得这样的结果。接下来我一定会加倍努力，不让您失望。你看这报告里的数据，这块细节怎么没做好，确实是我的问题，是我高估了自己的能力，后续的补救措施我已经拟好这事儿，还要靠领导继续为我们掌舵。你看你这脾气太毛躁，干不了大事啊。领导说的对，大事，您来做小事，我分担，我把小事做到极致，祝您成大事。这个核心项目交给你了，我对你期望很高啊，感谢领导的关心与信任。有，您在前面指点导航，我心里就有底了，一定全力以赴把项目拿下。小李，最近表现不错啊，我这个位置马上就该你坐了。听这意思，领导，您这是又要高升了呀，那我得提前敬您一杯。哈哈哈小王啊，看你今天喝不少，你这酒量挺好的。呀张总，您可抬举我了，我平时真不太能喝，这不今天和您在一起吃饭，高兴啊，这一高兴酒量就涨了，所以就多贪了几杯。小李啊，来这么晚只能给我们吃剩菜了吧。李总，饭在哪儿我都能吃，但您这桌可不是谁想做就能做的，能赶上吃就已经是我运气了。哈哈哈。关注我，每天学点高情商，说话技巧，让你的路越走越宽。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 1090,
      "text": "私下给你提个醒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1390,
      "end_ms": 3270,
      "text": "最近有人跑我这儿打你小报告。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3610,
      "end_ms": 5130,
      "text": "领导相比于谁说坏话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00004",
      "start_ms": 5190,
      "end_ms": 6610,
      "text": "我更在意怎样把工作做好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00005",
      "start_ms": 6690,
      "end_ms": 7390,
      "text": "如果是我的问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00006",
      "start_ms": 7390,
      "end_ms": 7930,
      "text": "我马上改，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00007",
      "start_ms": 8010,
      "end_ms": 8710,
      "text": "如果没问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00008",
      "start_ms": 8750,
      "end_ms": 9850,
      "text": "非常感谢您的信任。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00009",
      "start_ms": 10110,
      "end_ms": 13330,
      "text": "大家都看看小王这个月业绩做的这么好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00010",
      "start_ms": 14230,
      "end_ms": 15230,
      "text": "谢谢领导夸奖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00011",
      "start_ms": 15450,
      "end_ms": 16610,
      "text": "那都是我们的产品好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00012",
      "start_ms": 16630,
      "end_ms": 17210,
      "text": "团队强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00013",
      "start_ms": 17310,
      "end_ms": 18530,
      "text": "客户才会放心下单。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00014",
      "start_ms": 19950,
      "end_ms": 22010,
      "text": "看你手头这进度干活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00015",
      "start_ms": 22010,
      "end_ms": 23910,
      "text": "怎么比乌龟还慢慢俗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00016",
      "start_ms": 23910,
      "end_ms": 25470,
      "text": "俗说慢慢出细题吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00017",
      "start_ms": 25850,
      "end_ms": 27330,
      "text": "我细致对待每一个项目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00018",
      "start_ms": 27530,
      "end_ms": 29550,
      "text": "不就避免了以后出现质量问题吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00019",
      "start_ms": 29610,
      "end_ms": 32860,
      "text": "上次交代的那个重点项目现在推进的怎么样了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00020",
      "start_ms": 33000,
      "end_ms": 34420,
      "text": "领导第一阶段已完成，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00021",
      "start_ms": 34580,
      "end_ms": 36100,
      "text": "目前正处于复核阶段，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00022",
      "start_ms": 36300,
      "end_ms": 37920,
      "text": "预计本周内能够全部交到。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00023",
      "start_ms": 37920,
      "end_ms": 38360,
      "text": "您手上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00024",
      "start_ms": 38460,
      "end_ms": 39680,
      "text": "给你转了一千多的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00025",
      "start_ms": 39680,
      "end_ms": 41340,
      "text": "就当你跑腿的小辛苦费了啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00026",
      "start_ms": 41400,
      "end_ms": 41720,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00027",
      "start_ms": 41720,
      "end_ms": 42400,
      "text": "您太客气了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00028",
      "start_ms": 42400,
      "end_ms": 43160,
      "text": "水果没多少钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00029",
      "start_ms": 43360,
      "end_ms": 44640,
      "text": "您平时对我们这么照顾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00030",
      "start_ms": 44660,
      "end_ms": 47460,
      "text": "帮您买水果是我应该做的多的钱我不能收我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00031",
      "start_ms": 47460,
      "end_ms": 48420,
      "text": "这就给您退回去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00032",
      "start_ms": 48440,
      "end_ms": 48840,
      "text": "小王，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00033",
      "start_ms": 49120,
      "end_ms": 49620,
      "text": "早餐钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00034",
      "start_ms": 49620,
      "end_ms": 50560,
      "text": "我微信转给你了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00035",
      "start_ms": 50560,
      "end_ms": 51460,
      "text": "你赶紧接收一下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00036",
      "start_ms": 51560,
      "end_ms": 51840,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00037",
      "start_ms": 51840,
      "end_ms": 52600,
      "text": "您太客气了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00038",
      "start_ms": 52600,
      "end_ms": 53760,
      "text": "这都是我顺手的事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00039",
      "start_ms": 53800,
      "end_ms": 54880,
      "text": "本来不应该收的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00040",
      "start_ms": 54880,
      "end_ms": 56620,
      "text": "但是怕您下次有事就不找我了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00041",
      "start_ms": 56660,
      "end_ms": 58420,
      "text": "所以我就恭敬不如从命了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00042",
      "start_ms": 58900,
      "end_ms": 60370,
      "text": "小餐方案思路很清析，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00043",
      "start_ms": 60710,
      "end_ms": 61625,
      "text": "这次干的不错嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00044",
      "start_ms": 61900,
      "end_ms": 62685,
      "text": "谢谢领导的夸奖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00045",
      "start_ms": 62940,
      "end_ms": 64520,
      "text": "都是因为有您的指导和提点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00046",
      "start_ms": 64520,
      "end_ms": 65660,
      "text": "我才能取得这样的结果。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00047",
      "start_ms": 65740,
      "end_ms": 67300,
      "text": "接下来我一定会加倍努力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00048",
      "start_ms": 67320,
      "end_ms": 68015,
      "text": "不让您失望。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00049",
      "start_ms": 68300,
      "end_ms": 69625,
      "text": "你看这报告里的数据，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00050",
      "start_ms": 69890,
      "end_ms": 70970,
      "text": "这块细节怎么没做好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00051",
      "start_ms": 71210,
      "end_ms": 72295,
      "text": "确实是我的问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00052",
      "start_ms": 72500,
      "end_ms": 73725,
      "text": "是我高估了自己的能力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00053",
      "start_ms": 74080,
      "end_ms": 76320,
      "text": "后续的补救措施我已经拟好这事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00054",
      "start_ms": 76320,
      "end_ms": 78000,
      "text": "还要靠领导继续为我们掌舵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00055",
      "start_ms": 78220,
      "end_ms": 79745,
      "text": "你看你这脾气太毛躁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00056",
      "start_ms": 80080,
      "end_ms": 81185,
      "text": "干不了大事啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00057",
      "start_ms": 81480,
      "end_ms": 82245,
      "text": "领导说的对，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00058",
      "start_ms": 82600,
      "end_ms": 82900,
      "text": "大事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00059",
      "start_ms": 82900,
      "end_ms": 84060,
      "text": "您来做小事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00060",
      "start_ms": 84060,
      "end_ms": 84665,
      "text": "我分担，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00061",
      "start_ms": 85060,
      "end_ms": 86260,
      "text": "我把小事做到极致，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00062",
      "start_ms": 86380,
      "end_ms": 87255,
      "text": "祝您成大事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00063",
      "start_ms": 88160,
      "end_ms": 89675,
      "text": "这个核心项目交给你了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00064",
      "start_ms": 90070,
      "end_ms": 91195,
      "text": "我对你期望很高啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00065",
      "start_ms": 91980,
      "end_ms": 93445,
      "text": "感谢领导的关心与信任。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00066",
      "start_ms": 93750,
      "end_ms": 93910,
      "text": "有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00067",
      "start_ms": 93910,
      "end_ms": 95130,
      "text": "您在前面指点导航，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00068",
      "start_ms": 95190,
      "end_ms": 96155,
      "text": "我心里就有底了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00069",
      "start_ms": 96480,
      "end_ms": 98120,
      "text": "一定全力以赴把项目拿下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00070",
      "start_ms": 98200,
      "end_ms": 98600,
      "text": "小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00071",
      "start_ms": 98680,
      "end_ms": 99835,
      "text": "最近表现不错啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00072",
      "start_ms": 100120,
      "end_ms": 101685,
      "text": "我这个位置马上就该你坐了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00073",
      "start_ms": 102660,
      "end_ms": 103380,
      "text": "听这意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00074",
      "start_ms": 103380,
      "end_ms": 103700,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00075",
      "start_ms": 103700,
      "end_ms": 105060,
      "text": "您这是又要高升了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00076",
      "start_ms": 105060,
      "end_ms": 106255,
      "text": "那我得提前敬您一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00077",
      "start_ms": 106500,
      "end_ms": 108770,
      "text": "哈哈哈小王啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00078",
      "start_ms": 108910,
      "end_ms": 109870,
      "text": "看你今天喝不少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00079",
      "start_ms": 109890,
      "end_ms": 110810,
      "text": "你这酒量挺好的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00080",
      "start_ms": 110810,
      "end_ms": 111720,
      "text": "呀张总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00081",
      "start_ms": 111800,
      "end_ms": 112640,
      "text": "您可抬举我了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00082",
      "start_ms": 112640,
      "end_ms": 113725,
      "text": "我平时真不太能喝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00083",
      "start_ms": 113940,
      "end_ms": 115260,
      "text": "这不今天和您在一起吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00084",
      "start_ms": 115260,
      "end_ms": 115760,
      "text": "高兴啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00085",
      "start_ms": 115760,
      "end_ms": 117160,
      "text": "这一高兴酒量就涨了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00086",
      "start_ms": 117160,
      "end_ms": 118260,
      "text": "所以就多贪了几杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00087",
      "start_ms": 118280,
      "end_ms": 118860,
      "text": "小李啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00088",
      "start_ms": 119080,
      "end_ms": 121415,
      "text": "来这么晚只能给我们吃剩菜了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00089",
      "start_ms": 121760,
      "end_ms": 122140,
      "text": "李总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00090",
      "start_ms": 122300,
      "end_ms": 123340,
      "text": "饭在哪儿我都能吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00091",
      "start_ms": 123460,
      "end_ms": 125220,
      "text": "但您这桌可不是谁想做就能做的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00092",
      "start_ms": 125220,
      "end_ms": 126785,
      "text": "能赶上吃就已经是我运气了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00093",
      "start_ms": 127110,
      "end_ms": 127535,
      "text": "哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00094",
      "start_ms": 128290,
      "end_ms": 129035,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00095",
      "start_ms": 129470,
      "end_ms": 131190,
      "text": "每天学点高情商，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00096",
      "start_ms": 131310,
      "end_ms": 132305,
      "text": "说话技巧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5bc153fc172fe58c_s00097",
      "start_ms": 132770,
      "end_ms": 135165,
      "text": "让你的路越走越宽。"
    }
  ],
